# What the hosted image's build never sees (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; the context is the repository root).
# Working copies' dependencies, caches, card data, rules, data directories, secrets and everything else that is not the server's source.
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/data
**/dist
**/release
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
rules
docs
scripts
packages/*/test
packages/client
packages/desktop
packages/server/src
packages/ai/src
packages/ladder/src
